title: GPO Immediate Scheduled Task Deployed
id: a93bf7cf-f01c-4704-bd15-1cd4edfd373b
status: experimental
description: Detects creation of a Group Policy immediate scheduled task (ScheduledTasks.xml with an immediate task in SYSVOL), a technique to execute commands across all computers or users targeted by the GPO.
author: Alaris Global
references:
  - https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1484/001/
logsource:
  category: file_event
detection:
  selection:
    TargetFilename|contains: '\\SYSVOL\\'
    TargetFilename|endswith: 'ScheduledTasks.xml'
  condition: selection
fields:
  - TargetFilename
  - Image
falsepositives:
  - Legitimate GPO-deployed scheduled tasks
level: high
tags:
  - attack.persistence
  - attack.t1484.001
